  <item>
    <title>16医美 保湿&gt;补水，医&gt;美，医美内幕大揭秘！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6766696d15a5fd520e61cd54</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6766696d15a5fd520e61cd54</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Dec 2024 12:58:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期嘉宾】小金，前互联网人转行，在有医美“黄埔军校”之称的医美医院工作半年多</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnF3U92pXJcJN3EZU6qfmJ4UphAf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期聊的主题有些特殊，是一个有很多刻板印象的行业。但是本期的嘉宾小金，作为从互联网行业转行医美行业的现从业者，会跟大家分享很多关于医美行业的细节与内幕：医美和整容是一回事儿吗？护肤真的需要不停的补水吗？整容真的会越整越僵吗？如何正确看待自己的不完美？</span></p><span></span><p><span>听完这期播客，相信你会有自己的答案~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:12</a> 开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> 医美工作经历简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 转行医美行业的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> “入一行爱一行”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">04:41</a> 入行后如何补齐医美知识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> 行业要求：扎实的医美知识+“无自用不分享”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a> 医美行业刻板印象大揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 医美的划分，手术类与非手术类，医美≠整容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1251">20:51</a> 护肤的重点，保湿/锁水&gt;补水（保湿面霜涂起来！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 整容会越整越僵吗，选好医院和项目是关键！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a> 关于来整容的人的心态总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2141">35:41</a> 《再见爱人》葛夕的例子，不避讳&amp;为自己，fake it till you make it</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2391">39:51</a> 对行业的看法和展望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2679">44:39</a> 给医美小白的建议：选对医院；谨慎选择项目；“与自己和解”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 给想要入行的人的建议：夯实医美基础知识，明确初心，医美 医&gt;美！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3294">54:54</a> 小万对整容的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：热爱105°的你 by 阿肆，爱自己的不完美 by 老胡子男孩</span></p>]]></description>
