  <item>
    <title>15相声评书 旧瓶装新酒也很可乐！评的是哈利波特，相的是直播带货</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675eed5684447b1bd012706d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675eed5684447b1bd012706d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Dec 2024 02:38:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期返场嘉宾🎉】阿都，二十年的相声评书资深听众；JoJo，爱阎鹤祥大于爱相声评书的八年老粉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv4RF-5sGiZ2_JfgNBnJoYLdsXnc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期邀请了两位返场嘉宾聊他们喜欢的相声和评书~</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实听他们聊天的过程也挺像在听相声，清晰、流畅、生动的表达背后是他们多年积累的输入与对相声评书的热情；这也像相声评书这些年的发展一样，形式在变，内容在变，不变的是观众永远看得开心听的愉快~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 嘉宾简单自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a> 入坑相声&amp;评书的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 最近听的相声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">05:59</a> jojo喜欢阎鹤祥郭麒麟的原因：敢创新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 天津相声演员朱明鑫与直播带货</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> 爱的是内容与表达者的世界观、知识结构，而不是某种具体的表达形式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 喜欢相声&amp;评书的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">14:17</a> 阿都的安利：郭鹤鸣与哈利波特</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1121">18:41</a> 新一代的相声演员：钻研传统文化，讲透相声评书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1207">20:07</a> “阎鹤祥讲出了80后的落寞和孤寂”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> 其他几位还不为人熟知但各有特色的相声演员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2334">38:54</a> 给相声&amp;评书小白的作品安利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3039">50:39</a> 最后的分享：相声和评书是为了给观众带来快乐！要开心~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：说书人 by 小沈阳，探清水河 by 张云雷</span></p>]]></description>
