  <item>
    <title>14魔术 为成年人打造的梦，逃离现实感受神奇与快乐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673ae96343dc3a438781f194</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673ae96343dc3a438781f194</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Nov 2024 07:32:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期嘉宾】魔术师小洋，清华魔术社社长，7年份魔术师，40+次舞台表演经验，累计为20000+观众表演魔术</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhlE-CsK_QhDl8VgO8S7pKzcbci8.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>“接下来就是见证奇迹的时刻”，谈到魔术，大家可能第一反应都是刘谦在春晚舞台上的这句话。紧跟着这句话的就是奇迹发生的时刻，全球10多亿的华人将共同见证奇迹的发生，感受神奇，感受快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的嘉宾小洋，也是清华魔术社的社长，拥有7年的魔术表演经验，从需要手速的纸牌魔术、硬币魔术，再到仿佛心灵感应一般的心灵魔术，魔术师小洋已经累计为2w+的观众带来了精妙绝伦的表演。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期播客中，他会分享自己接触、学习、表演魔术的经历，会分享很多关于魔术的小秘密、小科普、小故事，也会打破很多大家对魔术的刻板印象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>看完这期播客，希望你们能够感受到魔术更多的魅力所在，在北京的朋友也欢迎去线下观看魔术师小洋的演出~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> 开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 魔术经历简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 入坑魔术的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">03:42</a> 魔术的科普</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="548">09:08</a> 关于“托儿”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 魔术的起源：萨满祭司</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> 喜欢魔术的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a> 学习与表演魔术的收获</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> 魔术小故事分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 喜欢的魔术师与魔术表演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2489">41:29</a> 大众对魔术的两大误区：托儿&amp;手速</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2833">47:13</a> 最近特别出圈的一个魔术表演：654俱乐部</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2994">49:54</a> 关于魔术的电影、教学视频、书籍以及歌曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a> 对行业的看法和展望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4269">01:11:09</a> 北京线下魔术观看安利：十二都魔术酒吧，full house魔术酒吧，二毛桌游bar</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4318">01:11:58</a> 魔术学习安利：@小远同学，@刘谦，b站【新版天才牌术】，《纸牌圣经》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4455">01:14:15</a> 魔术兼职收入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4715">01:18:35</a> 最后一个故事，圣诞节父亲给儿子变的魔术：编织一个神奇的梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：魔术先生 by 周杰伦，Merry Christmas Mr. Lawrence by 坂本龙一</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsQX5ijXpf7gVvJJdGhWYQyf-SId.m4a" length="80400243" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:22:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrBR2Of47dxjUm3YGWPKUh0GYDLg.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
