    <title>11脱口秀 从负面情绪中孕育快乐，脱口秀是解剖人生的痒痒挠</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67053b256c7f81778695fe4e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67053b256c7f81778695fe4e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Oct 2024 14:01:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期嘉宾】墨非，从22年开始上台的脱口秀自由演员，累计讲过100+场演出</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmoMeBhr2oKBXFwUSG3Z12Nf11D-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>“人人都能说5分钟脱口秀”，这可能是脱口秀在国内最流行的宣传标语了。但是就像脱口秀的英文实际上是stand-up comedy单口喜剧一样，人人都能讲5分钟脱口秀，原因不是因为人人都可以幽默，而更可能因为人人都有痛苦、有负面情绪，有想要表达的出口；说脱口秀的过程不仅仅是让观众快乐的过程，更是对自己的内心进行心理疗愈、解构自己的负面情绪的过程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期邀请了一位脱口秀演员，从22年至今已经登台100+场演出。从自己入行脱口秀的经历，关于脱口秀表演的技巧，还有经典的值得学习的作品推荐，满满的干货都浓缩在这一个多小时的录制中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果听完后也有想要上台讲脱口秀的冲动，冲吧！在评论区留言，可以介绍给你北京当地的开放麦报名机会哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">01:39</a> 墨非自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 入坑脱口秀的经历介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">05:07</a> 2022.3.8，第一次上台讲脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a> 如何在每一次上台中获得进步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a> 脱口秀演出中的表演技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 看线上脱口秀专场的感受：摇滚不死，只是在脱口秀永存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a> 墨非喜欢脱口秀的几点原因：让别人快乐，让自己快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1737">28:57</a> Laugh per minute, 成为脱口秀演员的黑科技</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a> 小万喜欢脱口秀的几点原因：表达观点，诚实面对自己与生活，简单直接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">38:56</a> 脱口秀的魅力：解构</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">39:53</a> 浓缩的讲脱口秀的一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2564">42:44</a> 如何优化自己的稿子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2904">48:24</a> 灵感来源，如何创作自己的稿子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2991">49:51</a> 墨非喜欢的脱口秀演员及专场：崔娃, Autisim Bikini Queen by Fern Brady, Joe List</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3084">51:24</a> 最爱崔娃的原因：根正苗红好青年，反PUA金牌导师🐶，模仿大师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3343">55:43</a> 小万喜欢的脱口秀演员及专场：乔治卡林, Louis CK, 阿金卡卡，Asian Comedian Destroys America by Ronny Cheing</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3509">58:29</a> 对脱口秀行业的看法和展望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4472">01:14:32</a> 给想要入坑讲脱口秀的朋友推荐的专场、书籍还有剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>专场：</span></p><span></span><p><span>pay back the funny by Trevor Noah</span></p><span></span><p><span>quarter-life crisis by Peter Tomlinson</span></p><span></span><p><span>lobby baby赛金花 by Seth Meyers</span></p><span></span><p><span>joke show by Michelle Wolf</span></p><span></span><p><span>It's bad for you by 乔治卡林</span></p><span></span><p><span>twenty three hours to kill by 宋飞</span></p><span></span><p><span>Corsets &amp; Clown Suits by Alex Borstein</span></p><span></span><p><span>剧：生活大爆炸，了不起的麦瑟尔夫人，地下交通站（豆瓣9.4分的国产喜剧）</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍：comedy bible喜剧圣经，单立人单口喜剧表演手册</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4806">01:20:06</a> 最后的寄语</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：今晚80后脱口秀节目开场BGM，怎么办安安 by 王勉</span></p>]]></description>
